    <li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #16244d;">
      <span style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #16244d;">03 · 3–10. hafta</span>
      <span style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', Geist, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1;">Uygulama</span>
